#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:2
#: 5b30f240f5a14caa9cff67b5b76fd908
msgid "0015. UI 组件库选型与参数覆写层架构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:4
#: 551d001425ce400bb3a9318a18c29a91
msgid "日期: 2026-08-24"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:5
#: 37f9104da22d4ae3a4d41ac77264e333
msgid "状态: 已接受（组件库现为 Ant Design 6，选型理由不变）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:7
#: 52afdd4d699f4bd2b5273cf80cbc15d0
msgid "上下文"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:9
#: 44d720feedf646f781b59ad117a1846c
msgid ""
"GUI 自 PyQt 大爆炸重构迁移到 Tauri 2（ADR-0014）后，原有的丰富交互（单位切换、tooltip "
"范围提示、分支默认值、右键菜单、模态弹窗、详情面板）以及界面视觉规范发生缺失。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:11
#: 19f49bdbefb8434f905ce24e0be45360
msgid "在补齐 PyQt 24 项能力以及 e2m2e 14 个公开工具的表单需求时，需要做出两项关键技术决策："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:12
#: fce7a078d4034a5e8b2880b285570f79
msgid "**界面组件库选型**：原生 HTML 控件缺乏高密度科学计算所需的步长控制、Tooltip、树形右键、模态弹窗及暗黑主题体系。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:13
#: 44e2be9313cb408e9dac33b786c80de2
msgid ""
"**参数范围/提示/单位权威源**：e2m2e Pydantic 模型提供基础类型与数学约束，但缺失 GUI 特定的 17 "
"个字段物理单位换算、富文本 tooltip 提示，以及部分 GUI 认知默认值（如 DRO 60000 km 相对上游 10000 km "
"标定默认）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:15
#: 91fa9fdd847742998fb5ae421c65aa98
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:17
#: 25ef53b2b25b46859be53e50f0399b92
msgid "**引入 Ant Design 5.x (`antd`) 作为统一 UI 组件库**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:18
#: d0c99e65ab9b4209a7382226113a56c3
msgid ""
"使用 Ant Design 的 `Form`、`InputNumber`（支持前缀/后缀单位与 "
"step/min/max）、`Select`、`Tree`、`Modal`、`Dropdown`（右键菜单）、`Tooltip` 等组件。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:19
#: 72442c36302a40cb8a3064a4e4082da7
msgid ""
"使用 antd 自带的 `ConfigProvider` 与 `theme.darkAlgorithm` / "
"`theme.defaultAlgorithm` 实现全局亮色/暗色主题切换，配合字号配置对齐 PyQt 版 8–16pt 规范。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:21
#: e1f717aa5c3e4866b3fca9feb3806274
msgid "**建立前端参数覆写层 (`frontend/src/paramOverlay/`)**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:22
#: 2d3f138a99ca4bffa698960b010998cb
msgid "**基础约束**以 e2m2e 导出的 JSON Schema 为基底（单一事实来源）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:23
#: 420dc34afd6542518b456949bf0c7c8e
msgid "**覆写层**定义静态映射字典："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:24
#: 7bcda83dbec4438e96a51cc61f02b42d
msgid ""
"`UNIT_DEFINITIONS`: 17 个字段的单位定义（km/m/DU、周期份额/度/弧度、年/月/日/时/秒/TU "
"等）及其换算系数、小数精度与步长。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:25
#: ab8f2659406f43d5890a953e03c9d44e
msgid "`BRANCH_DEFAULTS`: 15 种轨道类型与各族的 GUI 认知默认值表。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:26
#: 440a8705e5de4955915dc4821b3e93b6
msgid "`FIELD_TOOLTIPS`: 字段多行描述、严格边界提示（> / < / ~）与物理含义解释。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:27
#: 54b90704129c45299a0ba41eda742f06
msgid ""
"`ENUM_LABELS`: 整数枚举（如 `collinear_point`, `north_south`, `control_mode` "
"等）的人读中文/英文显示映射。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:28
#: f447ae36f8ed441e98d6a913636afe87
msgid ""
"表单生成引擎读取 Schema + 覆写层，自动合成带有单位下拉、范围占位提示、完整 Tooltip "
"与必填星号的控件，表单提交时统一由覆写层换算回 e2m2e 标准物理单位。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:30
#: cbb3c9c3d5ee49b8a29361f91f72a84c
msgid "结果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:32
#: 05a69717244c4b98ac0763f927b7bdb5
msgid "正向影响"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:33
#: 571eda38497041e4b1347f519d486629
msgid "科学计算高密度表单与树控件无需从头手搓，开发效率高、交互规范。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:34
#: cb27f9878c0a4ffaa1a7291bfa9da09f
msgid "保证上游 e2m2e 模型纯粹性的同时，完整恢复 PyQt 版所有精细的参数提示、单位换算与分支交互。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:35
#: 66be84867cda47a0a74ee9021a0058ba
msgid "主题切换与字号调节开箱即得。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:37
#: 9c91600088e84b7ab85e5707db5cb263
msgid "负向影响与代价"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0015-ui-framework-and-parameter-overlay.md:38
#: fd1692cb364044e6a21e3ccec3fa4d70
msgid "前端 bundle 体积增加（约增加 antd 及其依赖），但作为桌面端应用（Tauri）对几十 KB 体积不敏感。"
msgstr ""

